ight plus risk factors.","timeframe":"Not newly verified"},{"test":"Age-, sex- and risk-appropriate cancer screening","clinical_question":"Preclinical breast, colorectal, cervical or lung cancer","expected_finding":"Negative screening at the recommended interval or an abnormal result requiring timely diagnostic confirmation.","decision_rationale":"Inherited and not verified in this audit: Benefit depends on eligibility, interval and complete follow-through after an abnormal screen.","timeframe":"Not newly verified"},{"test":"Repeat or confirmatory diagnostic test after an abnormal screen","clinical_question":"False-positive screening result","expected_finding":"Diagnostic testing does not confirm disease.","decision_rationale":"Inherited and not verified in this audit: Screening tests do not by themselves establish many diagnoses.","timeframe":"Not newly verified"},{"test":"Medication and comorbidity review","clinical_question":"Secondary or iatrogenic risk","expected_finding":"A medicine, pregnancy state, renal disease or other condition explains or changes the preventive finding.","decision_rationale":"Inherited and not verified in this audit: Prevents inappropriate application of general-population screening or treatment advice.","timeframe":"Not newly verified"}],"evidence":{"sources":[{"id":"b5b625ed-5749-42c6-8d45-1dbfb60d06c0","title":"Recommendations","issuer":"NICE","edition":"Public recommendation/reference page retrieved 11 October 2026; retrieval is not clinical approval","url":"https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/ng238/chapter/recommendations","locator":"Risk assessment","primary_source":true},{"id":"ec6e54c2-ea08-4fc3-b872-180208fc83ea","title":"US Preventive Services Task Force A and B Recommendations","issuer":"Other","edition":"Current recommendations page retrieved 11 October 2026","url":"https://www.uspreventiveservicestaskforce.org/uspstf/recommendation-topics/uspstf-a-and-b-recommendations","locator":"A and B Recommendations table; eligibility and 